Diameter of a binary tree (longest path between any two nodes):

function diameterHelper(node):
    if node is null: return (0, 0)  // (diameter, height)
    (leftDia, leftH)  = diameterHelper(node.left)
    (rightDia, rightH) = diameterHelper(node.right)
    throughRoot = leftH + rightH
    dia = max(leftDia, rightDia, throughRoot)
    return (dia, 1 + max(leftH, rightH))

