Graph coloring check (k-colorable) using DFS backtracking:

function canColor(graph, v, colors, k):
    if v == V: return True
    for c in 1..k:
        if isSafe(graph, v, colors, c):
            colors[v] = c
            if canColor(graph, v+1, colors, k):
                return True
            colors[v] = 0
    return False

